Acknowledgement
---------------
UrbanFlow's feature set and terminology were informed by studying the behaviour and
architecture of CityFlow (https://github.com/cityflow-project/CityFlow, Apache License 2.0),
a multi-agent reinforcement-learning environment for large-scale city traffic scenarios.
No CityFlow source code is included in or derived into UrbanFlow; CityFlow was used as a
behavioural and architectural reference only. The optional CityFlow importer reads CityFlow's
public JSON file formats.
